hadiths[32]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1798","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Main ne apne nek bandon ke liye tayyar kiya hai jo na aankh ne dekha, na kaan ne suna, aur na insan ke dil par aaya, phir parho agar chaho: (Phir koi jaan nahi janti jo un ke liye aankhon ki thandak se chhupaya gaya hai)."
"1799","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tak pahunchate hue riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saaye mein sawar sau saal chale aur use na kaate."
"1800","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Saad (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saaye mein sawar sau saal chale aur use na kaate."
"1801","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis mein tez raftar tayyar ghode wala sawar sau saal chale aur use na kaate."
"1802","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Jannat walon se farmayega: Ae Jannat walo! Wo kahenge: Hazir hain, ae hamare Rab, aur tayyar hain, phir Wo farmayega: Kya tum razi ho gaye? To wo kahenge: Aur hamein kya ke hum razi na hon jabke Tune hamein wo diya jo Tune apni makhlooq mein se kisi ko na diya, phir Wo farmayega: Main tumhe is se afzal dunga, unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab! Aur is se afzal kaun si cheez hai? Phir Wo farmayega: Main tum par apni raza halal karunga, phir us ke baad tum par kabhi naraz na hunga."
"1803","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Saad (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat wale Jannat mein balakhano ko aise dekhenge jaise tum aasman mein sitare ko dekhte ho, unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Noman bin Abi Ayyash ko ye bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Abu Saeed ko bayan karte suna aur us mein izafa karte: Jaise tum doobte sitare ko mashriqi aur maghribi ufuq mein dekhte ho."
"1804","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat wale apne upar balakhano walon ko aise dekhenge jaise wo mashriq ya maghrib ke ufuq mein doobte chamakte sitare ko dekhte hain, un ke darmiyan fazeelat ki wajah se, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo Ambiya ki manzilein hain, unhe un ke siwa koi na payega, Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, wo mard jo Allah par iman laye aur Rasoolon ki tasdeeq ki."
"1805","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak pehla giroh jo Jannat mein dakhil hoga chaudahwin ke chand ki surat par hoga, phir jo un ke baad honge aasman mein sab se zyada roshan chamakte sitare par, na peshab karenge, na pakhana karenge, na thukenge, na naak saaf karenge, un ki kanghiyan sone ki hongi, un ka paseena mushk hoga, un ki angithiyan ood ki hongi, aur un ki biwiyan hoor ul een hongi, ek mard ki paidaish par, apne walid Adam ki surat par, aasman mein saath haath lambe."
"1806","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa al-Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khema khokhla moti hai, aasman mein us ki lambayi tees meel hai, us ke har kone mein momin ke liye ghar wale hain jinhe doosre na dekhenge."
"1807","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam ko paida kiya aur un ki lambayi saath haath thi, phir farmaya: Jao aur un farishton ko salam karo, phir suno wo tumhe kya tehniyat dete hain, tumhari aur tumhari aulad ki tehniyat, phir unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, phir unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaika wa rahmatullah, phir unhon ne izafa kiya wa rahmatullah, phir jo Jannat mein dakhil hoga Adam ki surat par hoga, phir makhlooq ghat-ti rahi yahan tak ke ab tak."
"1808","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari aag Jahannam ki aag ke sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai, kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Beshak wo kafi thi, Aap ne farmaya: Phir use un par unhattar hisson se fazeelat di gayi, un sab ki garmi us jaisi hai."
"1809","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jannat aur Aag ne jhagda kiya, phir Aag ne kaha: Mujhe mutakabbiron aur sakhton se khaas kiya gaya, aur Jannat ne kaha: Mujhe kya ke mujh mein sirf kamzor log aur gire hue dakhil hote hain? Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne Jannat se farmaya: Tum meri rehmat ho, tumhare sath apne bandon mein se jis par chahun rehem karunga, aur Aag se farmaya: Tum to azab ho, tumhare sath apne bandon mein se jis par chahun azab dunga, aur un dono mein se har ek ka bharna hai, rahi Aag to wo na bharegi yahan tak ke (Allah) apna qadam rakhe, phir wo kahegi: Bas bas bas, phir wahan wo bhar jayegi aur us ka baaz baaz ki taraf samet diya jayega, aur Allah Azza wa Jalla apni makhlooq mein se kisi par zulm na karega, aur rahi Jannat to Allah Azza wa Jalla us ke liye makhlooq paida karega."
"1810","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jahannam kehti rahegi: Kya izafa hai? Yahan tak ke Izzat wala Rab us mein apna qadam rakhe, phir wo kahegi: Bas bas, Teri izzat ki qasam, aur us ka baaz baaz ki taraf samet diya jayega."
"1811","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Maut safed siyahi mayel mendhe ki surat mein layi jayegi, phir pukarne wala pukarega: Ae Jannat walo! Phir wo gardan uthayenge aur dekhenge, phir wo kahega: Kya tum ise pehchante ho? To wo kahenge: Haan ye maut hai, aur un sab ne use dekha hoga, phir pukarega: Ae Aag walo! Phir wo gardan uthayenge aur dekhenge, phir wo kahega: Kya tum ise pehchante ho? To wo kahenge: Haan ye maut hai, aur un sab ne use dekha hoga, phir wo zibah ki jayegi, phir wo kahega: Ae Jannat walo! Hamesha rehna, phir maut nahi, aur Ae Aag walo! Hamesha rehna, phir maut nahi, phir (ye ayat) parhi: (Aur unhe hasrat ke din se darao jab mamla faisal kiya jayega jabke wo ghaflat mein hain, aur ye duniya wale ghaflat mein hain, aur wo iman nahi late)."
"1812","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Jannat wale Jannat ki taraf aur Aag wale Aag ki taraf ho jayenge to maut layi jayegi yahan tak ke use Jannat aur Aag ke darmiyan rakha jayega, phir wo zibah ki jayegi, phir pukarne wala pukarega: Ae Jannat walo! Maut nahi, aur Ae Aag walo! Maut nahi, phir Jannat wale apni khushi par khushi barhayenge aur Aag wale apne gham par gham barhayenge."
"1813","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kafir ke dono kandhon ke darmiyan tez sawar ke liye teen din ki musafat hai."
"1814","[AI-translation] Hazrat Harisa bin Wahb al-Khuzai (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Kya main tumhe Jannat walon ki khabar na dun? Har kamzor daba hua, agar Allah par qasam khaye to Allah use poora kare, kya main tumhe Aag walon ki khabar na dun? Har sakht bad-akhlaq mutakabbir."
"1815","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zamaa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khutba dete suna, aur Aap ne oontni aur use kaatne wale ka zikr kiya, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: (Jab us ka sab se bad-bakht utha), us ke liye ek izzat wala sakht mazboot mard apne khandan mein utha, jaise Abu Zamaa, aur Aap ne aurton ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Tum mein se ek karta hai, apni biwi ko ghulam ki tarah marta hai, phir ho sakta hai wo us se din ke aakhir mein hambistar ho, phir Aap ne unhe un ke paad se hansne mein naseehat ki aur farmaya: Tum mein se ek kyun hansta hai us se jo wo karta hai?"
"1816","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne Amr bin Amir bin Luhayy al-Khuzai ko Aag mein apni aantein kheenchta dekha, aur wo pehla tha jis ne saaiba oont chhore."
"1817","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum nange paon nange badan baghair khatna jama kiye jaoge, Aisha ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mard aur aurtein ek doosre ko dekhenge? To Aap ne farmaya: Mamla is se sakht hai ke unhe is ki fikr ho."
"1818","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba dene khade hue aur farmaya: Beshak tum nange paon nange badan baghair khatna jama kiye jaoge: (Jaise hum ne pehli paidaish shuru ki hum use wapas karenge) aakhir ayat tak, aur beshak Qayamat ke din makhlooq mein sab se pehle Ibrahim ko libas pehnaya jayega, aur meri ummat mein se kuch mardon ko laya jayega aur unhe bayein taraf le jaya jayega, phir main kahunga: Ae mere Rab! Mere chhote sathi, phir Wo farmayega: Beshak tum nahi jante unhon ne tumhare baad kya naya kiya, phir main kahunga jaise nek bande ne kaha: (Aur main un par gawah tha jab tak main un mein raha) is qaul tak: (Hikmat wala), unhon ne kaha: Phir kaha jayega: Beshak wo barabar apni ediyon par murtad hote rahe."
"1819","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Log teen tareeqon par jama kiye jayenge: Ragbat rakhne wale darne wale, aur do ek oont par, aur teen ek oont par, aur chaar ek oont par, aur dus ek oont par, aur baqiyon ko Aag jama karegi, wo un ke sath dopahar karegi jahan wo dopahar karenge, aur un ke sath raat guzaregi jahan wo raat guzarenge, aur un ke sath subah karegi jahan wo subah karenge, aur un ke sath shaam karegi jahan wo shaam karenge."
"1820","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: (Jis din log Rabbul Aalameen ke liye khade honge), yahan tak ke un mein se ek apne paseene mein apne kaanon ke aadhe tak doob jayega."
"1821","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log Qayamat ke din paseena bahayenge yahan tak ke un ka paseena zameen mein sattar haath jayega, aur unhe lagam dega yahan tak ke un ke kaanon tak pahunchega."
"1822","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se ek jab mar jata hai to us par us ka thikana subah shaam pesh kiya jata hai, agar wo Jannat walon mein se ho to Jannat walon mein se, aur agar wo Aag walon mein se ho to kaha jata hai: Ye tumhara thikana hai yahan tak ke Allah tumhe Qayamat ke din uthaye."
"1823","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bahar tashreef laye jab suraj doob chuka tha, phir Aap ne awaz suni aur farmaya: Yahud apni qabron mein azab diye jate hain."
"1824","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak banda jab apni qabr mein rakha jata hai aur us ke sathi us se wapas jate hain, aur beshak wo un ke jooton ki khadkhad sunta hai, to us ke paas do farishte aate hain aur use bithate hain aur kehte hain: Tum is mard (Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye) ke bare mein kya kehte they? Raha momin to wo kehta hai: Main gawahi deta hun ke wo Allah ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain, phir us se kaha jata hai: Aag mein se apne thikane ko dekho, Allah ne tumhe us ke badle Jannat mein se thikana diya hai, phir wo dono ko dekhta hai."
"1825","[AI-translation] Hazrat al-Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab momin apni qabr mein bithaya jata hai to us ke paas aaya jata hai, phir wo gawahi deta hai ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, phir wo Us ka qaul hai: (Allah iman walon ko pakki baat se sabit rakhta hai)."
"1826","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Talha (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabiyullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Badr ke din Quraish ke sardaaron mein se chaubees mardon ka hukm diya, phir wo Badr ke kunwon mein se ek gande badbudaar kunwen mein phenk diye gaye, aur Aap jab kisi qaum par ghalib aate to maidan mein teen raatein thehrte, phir jab Badr mein teesre din they to Aap ne apni sawari ka hukm diya aur us par kajaawa kasa gaya, phir Aap chale aur Aap ke sahaba Aap ke peeche chale aur unhon ne kaha: Hum nahi samajhte Aap apni kisi hajat ke siwa ja rahe hain, yahan tak ke Aap kunwen ke kinare khade hue aur unhe un ke aur un ke baapon ke naamon se pukarne lage: Ae falan bin falan aur Ae falan bin falan! Kya tumhe pasand hai ke tum ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki itaat ki hoti? Phir beshak hum ne wo pa liya jo hamare Rab ne hum se wada kiya tha sach, to kya tum ne wo paya jo tumhare Rab ne tum se wada kiya tha sach? Unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap un jismon se kya kalam karte hain jin mein roohein nahi? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, tum jo main kehta hun use sunne mein un se zyada nahi ho."
"1827","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja hain, wo koi cheez na suntein jise na jantein magar us mein wapas kartien yahan tak ke use jan lein, aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka hisab liya gaya use azab diya jayega, Aisha ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Kya Allah Taala nahi farmata: (Phir un ka aasan hisab liya jayega)? Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne farmaya: Wo to sirf peshi hai, lekin jis se hisab mein bareeki se poocha gaya wo halak hoga."
"1828","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi qaum par azab nazil karta hai to azab un mein jo ho use pahunchta hai, phir wo apne amalon par uthaye jayenge."
"1829","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zainab bint Jahsh (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas ghabraye hue tashreef laye aur farmate: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Arab ke liye us shar se halakat hai jo qareeb aa gaya, aaj Yajuj aur Majuj ki deewar se is jaisa khola gaya, aur Aap ne apne anguthe aur us se agli ungli se halqa banaya, Zainab bint Jahsh ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya hum halak honge jabke hum mein nek log hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan jab khabasat zyada ho jaye."
